  //   Overwrites the `extra_ref` u64 slot at [+24]. Silent no-op on
  //   out-of-range node_ref. Interpretation is kind-dependent:
  //   - Lit/Ident: type-pool pool_idx (HmCore).
  //   - List-node: next-sibling pool_idx.
  //   - Record: hash-index into a label-intern table.
  //   The module itself does not interpret the slot.
